1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
一碗粥，广东人吃的是"好意头"
A porridge Cantonese eat for good luck

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
广州·状元及第粥
Guangzhou — "top-scholar" congee

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
猪肝 瘦肉丸 猪粉肠，生滚白粥
Pork liver, meatballs, intestine in hot congee

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,400
米粒煮到开花，绵绸似绸缎
Rice simmered till it blooms, silky smooth

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,600
名字来自科举"三及第"
Named after the exam's top three ranks

6
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,800
穷孩子伦文叙，靠它高中状元
A poor boy aced the exam — then named it

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,000
三样猪杂，喻状元榜眼探花
Three organs for the top three scholars

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,200
高考前，广州人排队来一碗
Before big exams, locals queue for a bowl

9
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,400
广东人说：得闲饮茶，考试及第
"Tea when you're free, pass with ease"

10
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,600
你家乡，有讨吉利的早餐吗？
A lucky breakfast where you're from?

11
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,000
下集完结：放生菜会被"骂"的早餐
Finale: the breakfast that bans lettuce
